{"quest_id": 6478, "name": "剣刃の試練", "description": "第二の試練『剣刃の試練』\n洞窟を漂う意思持つ魔剣、\nリビングソードを討伐せよ！\n上級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv10）", "event": "凶鳥の射手", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920109, "map_no": 5338, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 40, "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 10, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アーマー"], "hp": 3000, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 600, "attack_range": 160, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 50, "attack_interval": 151, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2114800, "missile_id": 281, "missile": {"speed": 9.0}, "master_id": 31060, "global_id": 4679, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 2}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 11, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アンデッド"], "hp": 1000, "attack": 300, "base_hp": 1000, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 120, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 161, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2098672, "master_id": 168, "global_id": 167, "spawn_sec": 39}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アンデッド"], "hp": 15000, "attack": 250, "base_hp": 15000, "base_attack": 250, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 100, "attack_range": 180, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 40, "attack_interval": 117, "move_speed": 650.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2114784, "special_effect_id": 234, "missile_id": 279, "missile": {"speed": 12.0}, "master_id": 31059, "global_id": 4678, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 64}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 12, "form_count": 1, "hp": 520, "attack": 10, "base_hp": 520, "base_attack": 10, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 7, "attack_speed": 50, "attack_wait": 10, "move_speed": 2000.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2099152, "race_id": 11, "master_id": 165, "global_id": 164, "spawn_sec": 67}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アンデッド"], "hp": 2800, "attack": 750, "base_hp": 2800, "base_attack": 750, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 280, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 160, "move_speed": 1600.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2102064, "master_id": 354, "global_id": 353, "spawn_sec": 97}, {"enemy_id": 6, "source": "local", "count": 8, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アンデッド"], "hp": 800, "attack": 250, "base_hp": 800, "base_attack": 250, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_range": 120, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 111, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2098656, "missile_id": 23, "missile": {"speed": 2.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 167, "global_id": 166, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 106}, {"enemy_id": 7, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アンデッド"], "hp": 3000, "attack": 600, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 600, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 220, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 181, "move_speed": 450.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.75, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2098688, "master_id": 169, "global_id": 168, "spawn_sec": 142}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "イロハ", "text": "お墓が並んで……不気味なところですね……。\nおばけでも出そうな雰囲気です……。", "face": "u242"}, {"name": "シャロン", "text": "あら、おばけが相手なら、\n私やヒューナさんがいるから大丈夫ですよ。", "face": "u283"}, {"name": "ヒューナ", "text": "そうね、アンデッド全般が専門分野だから。\n……っと、この辺りね、第二の試練の場は。", "face": "u627"}, {"name": "シャロン", "text": "次の試練はどんな内容なのでしょう？", "face": "u283"}, {"name": "ヒューナ", "text": "「舞い踊る剣と斬り結べ」……？\nいったいどういう意味なのかしら……。", "face": "u627"}, {"name": "イロハ", "text": "――はっ、殺気……ッ！？\nヒューナさん、危ないッ！！", "face": "u242"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "ど、どこかから剣が飛んで……！？", "face": "l616b59afdfd8"}, {"name": "ヒューナ", "text": "うっ……ありがとう、イロハさん。\nけれどいったいどこから剣が……？", "face": "u627"}, {"name": "シャロン", "text": "宙に浮き、ひとりでに振り抜かれる魔剣……。\nあれはアンデッドではありません、\n魔力で動く剣、リビングソードです……！", "face": "u283"}, {"name": "シャロン", "text": "王子、魔力のこめられた斬撃に注意してください！", "face": "u283"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "イロハ", "text": "おばけでないなら斬り捨てられます。\nふぅ、これで第二の試練は突破ですね。", "face": "u242"}, {"name": "ヒューナ", "text": "ふふっ、最初の怖がり方がまるで嘘みたい。\n東の国のサムライの剣技、かっこよかったわ。", "face": "u627"}, {"name": "イロハ", "text": "そ、そうでしょうか……。\nそんな風に真正面から褒められると、\n照れてしまいますね……。", "face": "u242"}, {"name": "ヒューナ", "text": "（この試練、私一人では、\n突破出来なかった可能性が高いわ……）", "face": "u627"}, {"name": "ヒューナ", "text": "（仲間を連れて行けと、\n『この子』が言った理由はこのため……？）", "face": "u627"}, {"name": "シャロン", "text": "少し、打ち解けてきたみたいですね？", "face": "u283"}, {"name": "ヒューナ", "text": "うっ……そ、そんなこと……。\nほら、次の試練に向かうわよ！", "face": "u627"}]}], "active": true}